            "review_title": "Review at Thao Nguyen - Pho Ga Ha Noi Xua",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nOverrated in my opinion\nJan 2019 • Solo\nThis place gets top reviews on Foody - a site which is much more popular than TripAdvisor here in Hanoi. It receives high marks on Foody for its cleanliness and deliciousness. I didn't find the place to be as clean as the reviews indicated. And, I didn't think that the broth was spectacular - nor was the portion of meat particularly generous. That said, when I pulled up, there were tons of motorbikes parked in front which is usually really good sign. Perhaps I hit them on an off day. I know that I was a bit late in the morning rush. But, still, I would have expected more. The portion of quay was also pretty slim. Honestly, even though this place gets top reviews as one of the best pho in Tay Ho, I'm not quite buying.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 17, 2019",
